@startuml
title Weather Station System State Diagram

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> [*]
state "Idle" as Idle
state "Configured" as Configured
state "Running" as Running
state "Collecting Data" as CollectingData
state "Preparing Summary" as PreparingSummary
state "Checking Status" as CheckingStatus
state "Controlled" as Controlled
state "Shut Down" as ShutDown

Idle --> Configured : changes or power-saving settings required
Configured --> Running : configuration completed
Running --> CollectingData : clock triggered data collection
CollectingData --> Running : data collection complete
Running --> PreparingSummary : summary preparation requested
PreparingSummary --> Running : summary prepared
Running --> CheckingStatus : status checking requested
CheckingStatus --> Running : status checked
Controlled --> Running : remote control exit
ShutDown --> [*] : shutdown command received

@enduml
